<title>USA: BE expects improving margins.</title>
<headline>BE expects improving margins.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON, Fla. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>B/E Aerospace Inc said on Thursday it expects continued margin expansion for the next several years as the market continues to improve for refurbishing commercial aircraft.</p>
<p>&quot;Future increases in our revenues are expected to be driven by the strong ongoing level of refurbishment and upgrade activity by the airlines, the sizable forecasted increase in new commercial aircraft production and the rapid growth of the company's In-Flight Entertainment Division,&quot; B/E vice chairman and chief executive Robert Khoury said in a statement.</p>
</text>
